                    "text": "in 2 Cutoff in Hz @min 1 @max samplerate*0.5 @default 500"
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "code": "\r\n// simultaneous outputs for all filters available from a linear TPT SVF Topology\r\n// that use just Cutoff & Q, with optional cutoff & resonance smoothing baked in\r\n// by pete for evieve\r\n// this is probably useless in practice, but maybe someone will find it useful\r\n\r\nHistory\tstate1(0), state2(0);\r\n\r\nParam\tcutoffsmoothbase(2, min=0, max=10); // Hz\r\nParam\tcutoffsmooth(20, min=0, max=100);\t// ms\r\nParam\tresonancesmooth(10, min=0, max=100);// ms\r\n\r\nQ\t\t= in3;\t\t\t\t\t            // Q\r\nR\t\t= 1 / (Q + Q);                      // resonance\r\nif (resonancesmooth > 0)\r\n\tR\t= evi_expsmooth(R, resonancesmooth);\r\nR2\t\t= R + R;\r\n\r\nC\t\t= in2;\t\t\t\t\t            // cutoff in Hz\r\ng       = evi_tan( PI * C / SAMPLERATE );\r\nif (cutoffsmooth > 0)\r\n\tg\t= evi_cfsmooth(g, cutoffsmooth, hz=cutoffsmoothbase);\r\n\r\nX\t\t= in1;\r\n\r\n// filter core\r\nHp\t\t= (X - ((R2 + g) * state1) - state2) / (1 + (R2 * g) + (g * g));    // highpass\r\ngHp\t\t=  g * Hp;\r\nBp\t\t=  gHp + state1;        // bandpass\r\ngBp\t\t=  g * Bp;\r\nLp\t\t=  gBp + state2;        // lowpass\r\n\r\n// update state\r\nstate1\t=  gHp + Bp;\r\nstate2\t=  gBp + Lp;\r\n\r\n// types\r\nUp\t\t= R2 * Bp;\t\t\t\t// reson (can take very high Q)\r\nPp\t\t= Lp - Hp;\t\t\t\t// peak\r\nNp\t\t= X -  Up;\t\t\t\t// notch\r\nAp\t\t= X - (Up + Up);\t\t// allpass (normalised)\r\n\r\n// crazy simultaneous outputs\r\nout1\t= Lp;\r\nout2\t= Bp;\r\nout3\t= Hp;\r\nout4\t= Pp;\r\nout5\t= Np;\r\nout6\t= Up;\r\nout7\t= Ap;\r\n\r\n",
                    "fontface": 0,
                    "fontname": "<Monospaced>",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "obj-3",
                    "maxclass": "codebox",
                    "numinlets": 3,
                    "numoutlets": 7,
                    "outlettype": [ "", "", "", "", "", "", "" ],
                    "patching_rect": [ 30.0, 54.0, 702.0, 736.0 ]
                }
